      "text": "Amazon Web Services EKS is a managed Kubernetes service that lets you run \n        Kubernetes without managing control plane infrastructure.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Amazon Web Services EKS is a managed Kubernetes service that lets you run \n        Kubernetes without managing control plane infrastructure.",
